    "description": "The copied f5 legal_root_san/named_uci display fields list the six king-reply options, including Kf5. The actual work.rootRestriction and returned complete root inventory correctly contain eight legal replies. In particular, Black owns f5 immediately, so Kf5 is unavailable; exf5+ and gxf5+ are legal. No query/result has been rewritten.",
